 Nick Braun (Succession) and Ron Perlman. As well as a supporting role portraying real life Torpedo Bomber and World War 2 hero, George Gay, in Roland Emmerich's upcoming World War 2 epic Midway ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1990\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d104\"},\"ref\":\"d104\",\"snippet\":\" ... Luis Miguel's main theme song<\\\\/a>, from his now-iconic album Mis Romances<\\\\/em>, lent even more star power to the novel.<\\\\/p>\\\\n<\\\\/div>\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image_credit\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\\\/\\\\/ \\\\n\\\\tThe Story:<\\\\/strong> In the Mexican telenovela<\\\\/em>, a woman, played by singer\\\\/actress Daniela Romo ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.billboard.com/lists/best-telenovela-theme-songs/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... played Victoria Lord #3 on One Life to Live from 1971 until the show ended its network television run on ABC on January 13, 2012, and resumed the role in its short-lived online revival on April 29, 2013.\\n\\nOther actors have played several characters on different shows ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soap_opera\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d105\"},\"ref\":\"d105\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the beginning, Venezuelan telenovelas followed the telenovela rosa format of a poor Cinderella who falls in love with Prince charming. Later in the 1980s, writers began writing realistic telenovelas that reflected everyday life of the common citizens where the audience could relate with the characters with telenovelas ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telenovela\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d117\"},\"ref\":\"d117\",\"snippet\":\" ... As a genre, it has different features from the soap and telenovela. Many writers and directors believe that the style of telling the story makes a difference. Because dizis are shot in natural settings12 and because dialogues are performed almost in real time, dizis are \\\"naturally slow\\\". The ... \",\"title\":\"https://journals.openedition.org/tvseries/2406\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"fe15455d351bcd16a44e9e755c051abe90727a7446b53fb2d75f4afe70e390c4\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"8b659b9c1e48184d933963c07f3683a1ad33fc45aa62d3595eeb98023afd87a1\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"telenovela actress real life relative plays different character\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f72797d99a5b4700939ddc9e"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Aidy Bryant's Hulu series Shrill and in the 2019 film James vs. His Future Self. In 2023, he joined season 4 of Apple TV+'s critically acclaimed science fiction drama For All Mankind as the character Eli Hobson.\\n\\nHe and actress Laure Mattos have been married ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/movies/home-alone-cast-where-are-they-now/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d178\"},\"ref\":\"d178\",\"snippet\":\" ... He died in Watchung, New Je