\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... He continued acting in countless films and TV series until his death. Caan is survived by five children and four grandchildren.\\n\\nBrett Tuggle\\n\\nThe renowned veteran musician and celebrated keyboardist died on June 19, after a battle with cancer. He was 70. The news of his death was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/stars-weve-lost-in-2022-177426\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d221\"},\"ref\":\"d221\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the early 1970s, she landed minor roles in film and TV, and finally won a role on the series Three's Company (1976). She married Hamel in 1977. She was fired from the series after she asked for a raise at the beginning of the fifth season ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2023&ref_=nmbio_dth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2003, Mulroney played Gavin Mitchell on the TV series Friends. He appeared in three episodes of the ninth season, his character briefly dating Rachel. This would mark Mulroney's last on-screen appearance on television for a number of years, later revealing in a May 2007 interview ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"0bd5b5547ed5c91b688ba1eb52924dd2bbe0e8ece93cbe18d1ab1339e421da67\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b2ce8085dacca2c4452541e39f0f7f01a2594a0d37563187341eaa53dcdb4135\",\"semanti